{"id":"157244bd3dfd5b5d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-handlebody.md","title":"Handlebody","display":"df-handlebody — Handlebody","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-handlebody","aliases":["58-df-handlebody","Handlebody"],"display":"df-handlebody — Handlebody","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-handlebody"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-handlebody</span><span>Handlebody</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-handlebody — Handlebody"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"580cc04d629fcdb8\" href=\"?note=580cc04d629fcdb8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md\">../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq2\">\\(n\\geq2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\omega\">\\(g\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> (manifold candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:n+1\\to\\omega\">\\(c:n+1\\to\\omega\\)</span> (number of handles of each index)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S\\)</span> (handle-decomposition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"580cc04d629fcdb8\" href=\"?note=580cc04d629fcdb8\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md\">../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handlebody} \\vdash \\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(M,n,g)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land n\\geq2\\land g\\in\\omega\\land\\exists c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,n+1,\\omega)\\land c(0)=1\\land c(1)=g\\land\\forall k\\in(n+1)\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\;(c(k)=0)\\land\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S(M,n,c)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handlebody} \\vdash \\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(M,n,g)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land n\\geq2\\land g\\in\\omega\\land\\exists c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,n+1,\\omega)\\land c(0)=1\\land c(1)=g\\land\\forall k\\in(n+1)\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\;(c(k)=0)\\land\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S(M,n,c)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This defines an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-dimensional 1-handlebody by a handle decomposition with one <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>-handle, exactly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-handles, and no handles of any other index.</li>\n<li>The upstream handle-decomposition predicate supplies the typed attachment maps and intermediate manifolds; the former assertion called an attaching-map predicate with the wrong arity and left gluing and isomorphism untyped.</li>\n<li>The boundary has genus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> in the familiar surface sense only when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=3\">\\(n=3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A general handle decomposition may contain handles of all indices and is a separate notion.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Rolfsen, Knots and Links</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md","status":"resolved","id":"580cc04d629fcdb8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md","status":"resolved","id":"580cc04d629fcdb8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S$ (handle-decomposition predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-handle-decomposition.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-coded function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"c:n+1\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}handlebody} \\vdash \\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(M,n,g)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\land n\\geq2\\land g\\in\\omega\\land\\exists c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,n+1,\\omega)\\land c(0)=1\\land c(1)=g\\land\\forall k\\in(n+1)\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\;(c(k)=0)\\land\\mathrm{HandleDecomp}_S(M,n,c)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"n=3","display":false}],"bytes":1670,"backlinks":[{"id":"1b06c1162d3facfd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H',3,g)$（see [[../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-605","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md|58-df-handlebody]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["580cc04d629fcdb8","36d7463d215be751"]}